            to write the file. Created if it does not exist. Defaults to
            PRESENTATION_OUTPUT_DIR.
        theme: Named template palette — one of business (navy/gold),
            fashion (black/gold serif), tech (slate/cyan), health (teal),
            education (indigo/amber), minimal (monochrome). Default business.

    Returns:
        Absolute path to the generated .pptx file.', 'python_function', 'custom', '{"function_name": "_run_tool", "code": "from tools.presentation_tools import gen_pptx\n\n\nasync def _run_tool(**kwargs) -> str:\n    \"\"\"用我：把 slides_json 渲染成 PPTX。     别用我：普通文档用 write_file；要同时出 HTML+PPTX 用 doc_to_deck。 Generate a styled PowerPoint (.pptx) deck from a slides JSON outline.      Arg\"\"\"\n    return str(await gen_pptx.ainvoke({**kwargs}))\n", "args_schema": {"title": {"type": "string", "description": ""}, "slides_json": {"type": "string", "description": ""}, "output_dir": {"type": "string", "description": "", "default": ""}, "theme": {"type": "string", "description": "", "default": "business"}}}', '{"type": "object", "properties": {"title": {"type": "string", "description": ""}, "slides_json": {"type": "string", "description": ""}, "output_dir": {"type": "string", "description": "", "default": ""}, "theme": {"type": "string", "description": "", "default": "business"}}, "required": ["title", "slides_json"]}', 'string', NULL, '{"category": "presentation", "order": 17, "section": null, "is_concurrency_safe": true, "output_schema": null, "guard": {"approval": false, "confirmation": false}, "presentation": {}}', TRUE, TRUE, 'builtin-seeder', FALSE, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, '1.0.0', NULL, 'presentation', TRUE, NULL, '["builtin", "presentation"]', '2026-08-01 14:44:18.034629+00:00', '2026-10-31 11:06:22.628527+00:00'
